# Admin Role

Operations Manager only: monitor students/instructors/courses, support tickets, operational reports. No system config, finance, research, roles, or user creation.

## Sidebar

Dashboard · Students · Instructors · Courses · Support Tickets · Reports · Notifications · Profile · Logout

## Dashboard

Stats: Total Students, Total Instructors, Total Courses, Active Courses, Open Support Tickets, Total Users.
**No** revenue/expenses/profit/withdrawals/shareholders (Finance only).
Recent Support Tickets + Academic Overview (monitor) + Recent Users. Notifications via header only.

## Key rules

- Students: view, enable/disable — never delete
- Instructors & Courses: view only (no approve/reject/create)
- Support: reply, close, reopen — core responsibility
- Academic actions (approve courses/certs/activations): only if Super Admin grants; default view-only
- No finance, payments, research, system settings, roles, or user creation
